      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.77,
      "end_seconds": 10.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 13.92,
      "end_seconds": 22.78,
      "duration_seconds": 8.86,
      "text": "Hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay. We came cos of itchy spots all over."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.54,
      "end_seconds": 27.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.97,
      "end_seconds": 33.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "well I'd say about a month maybe"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 34.42,
      "end_seconds": 40.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I, I think it's been nearer about two months, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.14,
      "end_seconds": 45.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "okay, so so roughly one to two months. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.6,
      "end_seconds": 48.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "That sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.29,
      "end_seconds": 52.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "okay, go on how frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.18,
      "end_seconds": 57.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "It happens a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.77,
      "end_seconds": 66.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Have you been feeling achy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.84,
      "end_seconds": 75.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.88,
      "text": "mm, yes as for feeling achy, I'd give it a six, out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.07,
      "end_seconds": 77.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "okay, go on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.88,
      "end_seconds": 89.76,
      "duration_seconds": 8.88,
      "text": "Oh, you know, and a mild temperature. That's been about the same, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.45,
      "end_seconds": 105.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "has there been any stiff neck?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.63,
      "end_seconds": 109.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "no, none, no stiff neck"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.35,
      "end_seconds": 114.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Any pregnancy, breathlessness or being immunosuppressed?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.85,
      "end_seconds": 117.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Nope, nothing like that."
